[TEXT] **Key findings from keepalived configs:**
- **`advert_int 4`** on ALL VRRP instances — 4-second advertisement interval (default is 1s). This gives a `Master_Down_Interval = 3×4 = 12 seconds` before a backup preempts.
- Priorities are very asymmetric: dswa1 is priority 105 for VI_10/VI_99; dswa2 is priority 1 for those same instances.
- VRRP runs on the data interfaces (`br0.10`, etc.) — no dedicated heartbeat link configured.
- No `track_interface`, no `track_script`, no `unicast_peer` — bare minimal config.

